{
  "description": [
    "Publish an HTML page at `slug`, or republish it, or change only its settings.",
    "",
    "Step 2 of 2 after artifact_upload_url: pass its `upload`. A new page needs an",
    "upload and a title; later calls without `upload` change settings only. Returns the",
    "page URL; give it to the user. `daimon_id` (from list_daimons) is the Daimon that holds the page.",
    "`access`: `workspace` (everyone on the team, the default), \"people\" (only",
    "`people`) or \"public\" (anyone with the link, which the URL carries). `people` and",
    "`editors` are people in the app, named by their id there, a chat user id or an",
    "@mention. Editors republish and change settings. `expires_in_days` takes the page",
    "offline after that many days (0 means never). A page going public expires in 30 days",
    "unless you set one. A public page cannot write data, ask, or both read data and send",
    "events.",
    "`data` is \"off\", \"read\" or \"write\": whether page code can read or also write the",
    "page's data. `events` lets page code send events your watches can wake on; `ask`",
    "lets viewers ask you from the page. `data_scale` (1-10) multiplies the data caps.",
    "`rules` sets what viewers may do per collection, replacing the page's rules:",
    "{\"votes\": {\"read\": \"all\"|\"own\", \"write\": \"all\"|\"own\"|\"none\"}}, where \"own\" is the",
    "documents that viewer created. Owners and editors are not bound by them, and nor are",
    "you when you act for one; you follow them for anyone else.",
    "`new_link` replaces a public page's link."
  ],
  "parameters": {
    "$defs": {
      "CollectionRule": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "What a page's viewers may do in one collection: `own` is the documents they created.\nManagers are not bound by it, nor are tools acting for one.",
        "properties": {
          "read": {
            "default": "all",
            "enum": [
              "all",
              "own"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "write": {
            "default": "all",
            "enum": [
              "all",
              "own",
              "none"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "access": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "enum": [
              "workspace",
              "people",
              "public"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "ask": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "daimon_id": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "data": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "read",
              "write"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "data_scale": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "editors": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "editors_can_share": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "events": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "expires_in_days": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "new_link": {
        "default": false,
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      "people": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "rules": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/CollectionRule"
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "slug": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      },
      "upload": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "type": "null"
          }
        ],
        "default": null
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "daimon_id",
      "slug"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  }
}
